commission upon the closing of the Business Combination of 3.25% of the gross proceeds of the IPO or $2,803,125, which amount is not
subject to change based on redemption levels. The following illustrates the effective deferred underwriting fee on a percentage basis
for public shares at each redemption level identified below:</FONT></P>

