Group&rsquo;s trade receivables increased by approximately US$148,000 from approximately US$242,000 as of December 31, 2021 to approximately
US$390,000 as of December 31, 2022, which is in line with the increase in sales as mentioned above.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"></P>

