GROUP&rsquo;S</FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"> DIRECTORS AND EXECUTIVE OFFICERS PRIOR
TO THE BUSINESS COMBINATION</FONT></P>

