<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
fair value measurements are based on the above leasehold land and buildings&rsquo; highest and best use, which does not differ from their
actual use.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.4in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Had
the Group&rsquo;s leasehold land and buildings been carried at cost less accumulated depreciation, the carrying amount of the Group&rsquo;s
leasehold land and buildings as of December 31, 2022 and 2021 would have been approximately US$4,118,381 and US$4,584,117 respectively.</FONT></P>

