<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Expected
loss rates are based on actual loss experience. These rates are adjusted to reflect differences between economic conditions during the
period over which the historic data has been collected, current conditions and the Group&rsquo;s view of economic conditions over the
expected lives of the receivables.</FONT></P>

