<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;<U>Key
Personnel</U>&rdquo; has the meaning set forth in <U>Section 5.22(a)</U>.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;<U>Know-How</U>&rdquo;
means all information, unpatented inventions (whether or not patentable), improvements, practices, algorithms, formulae, trade secrets,
techniques, methods, procedures, knowledge, results, protocols, processes, models, designs, drawings, specifications, materials and any
other information related to the development, marketing, pricing, distribution, cost, sales and manufacturing of products.</FONT></P>

